    in the list. Returns all of the summed values in a list.

    >>> fix_3([1, '1', 2, None])
    <class 'TypeError'>
    <class 'TypeError'>
    <class 'TypeError'>
    <class 'IndexError'>
    []

    >>> fix_3([1, 2, 3, 4])
    <class 'IndexError'>
    [3, 5, 7]

    >>> fix_3([])
    []
